      "claim": "GR section3 starts with a32-bit count and uses44-byte records; position atrecord+4 and scale atrecord+28 pass through, rotation atrecord+16 multiplies byfloat32 0.01745329238474369, and finalrecord+40 is narrowed to16bits for15c329b4.",
